  "description": "DCMP-2 DCMP2-056: a continuation after a challenge. The continued request (attempt 1) keeps its one response, the challenge; the approval is an EBMP-2 human_intervention event whose operation is approve, whose target is the continued request and whose causal predecessor is the challenge; the continuation is a new request (attempt 2) with the same action, actor, subject and requested authority, which names the three in continues and lists the challenge and the approval among its causal predecessors. Each object is shown as the payload that an ECL-IE-1 envelope signs. Example identifiers only. Every object names one trust policy, conformance/fixtures/evidence/trust-policy.json, and the requests, the response and the approval each require the key of their own role in it."
